        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Karen Joy Fowler, Bruce Chatwin, Pat Murphy\n- Awards: James Tiptree Jr. Award\n- Events: WisCon\n- Roles: author, travel writer, novelist, journalist\n\nFacts:\n- Karen Joy Fowler was born on February 7, 1950, and she is an American author of science fiction, fantasy, and literary fiction.\n- Bruce Chatwin was born on May 13, 1940, and died on January 18, 1989, and he was an English travel writer, novelist, and journalist.\n- In February 1991, science fiction authors Pat Murphy and Karen Joy Fowler initiated the James Tiptree Jr. Award after a discussion at WisCon.",
